class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的处理时点，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 被省略作为基准期。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_{-3}, \\beta_{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0 而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之后跳升，通常被视为平行趋势成立、政策有效的证据。但这套做法有两个已被明确证伪的暗礁。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>用预趋势检验证伪平行趋势在统计上是低功效的</strong>。Roth（2022, <em>AER: Insights</em>）证明：当平行趋势实际不成立时，预检验往往仍会「通过」，因为它只利用少量前期数据；反过来，过度依据预检验结果筛选设定会引入偏误。把「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不显著」当作平行趋势成立的证据是一种系统性误读。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>平行趋势被违反时，效应估计可以有多敏感，是可以量化的</strong>。Rambachan &amp; Roth（2023, <em>Review of Economic Studies</em>）提出 <strong>HonestDiD</strong>：不再假设事后偏离平行趋势为 0，而是假设偏离幅度不超过事前趋势的某个倍数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，在此约束下计算效应置信区间，报告「要使结论翻转，需要的偏离有多大」。这把敏感性分析从口头辩护变成了可报告的数字。</p>\n<p>当处理组很少、对照组是「少数几个大单位」时（例如评估某国补贴对他国的溢出），<strong>合成控制法</strong>（Abadie, Diamond &amp; Hainmueller, 2010, <em>JASA</em>）更合适：用若干未处理单位的加权组合构造与处理单位事前轨迹高度拟合的「合成反事实」，权重由事前拟合优度决定，推断靠置换检验。<strong>合成 DID</strong>（Arkhangelsky et al., 2021, <em>AER</em>）把合成控制与 DID 结合，同时给出单位权重与时间权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从补贴额到因果效应-识别策略的实战设计\">从补贴额到因果效应：识别策略的实战设计</h2><p>理论正确不等于估计可信。产业政策的实战评估里，决定成败的往往是四个具体判断。</p>\n<p><strong>处理时点的选择。</strong> CHIPS 类政策跨数年，必须明确回答的是「哪个事件」。若企业能提前预期，还会出现<strong>预期效应（anticipation）</strong>：处理前一年的系数已经跳升，这不是平行趋势失败，而是处理定义错了——此时应把处理时点前移，而非丢弃前trend。</p>\n<p><strong>处理强度的内生性。</strong> 补贴金额取决于企业规模与谈判能力，不是外生变量。用「补贴额占营收比」做连续处理回归会放大内生性；稳妥做法是二值化处理（是否进入补贴名单），或寻找<strong>制度性断点</strong>（评分门槛、产能上限）做模糊断点回归。</p>\n<p><strong>同期政策的叠加与溢出。</strong> 2022 年前后，美国 CHIPS/IRA、欧盟《欧洲芯片法案》（约 430 亿欧元）与《净零工业法案》、各州级税收激励几乎同时出台。研究「某一项政策」时，其他政策构成处理组的<strong>同期冲击</strong>；更严重的是 <strong>SUTVA 违背</strong>——被补贴企业可能从外国或本国未补贴企业处<strong>虹吸</strong>资本与人才（贸易转移），此时对照组本身也受政策影响，ATT 会被低估或高估，取决于溢出方向。</p>\n<p><strong>对照组的构造。</strong> 用<strong>未中标企业</strong>（如 CHIPS 申请被拒者）对照最干净，但被拒样本可能选择性偏误；用<strong>同产业外国企业</strong>对照接近自然实验，但受汇率与外国政策干扰；用<strong>合成控制</strong>适合单一处理单位。可行数据包括美国商务部 CHIPS 项目名单、BEA/Census 县级就业数据（QCEW）与上市公司财报（Compustat）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构模型与一般均衡评估\">结构模型与一般均衡评估</h2><p>DID 与事件研究回答的是「处理组相对对照组变了多少」，它们<strong>在结构上无法回答</strong>三个产业政策最核心的问题：补贴的<strong>福利净额</strong>是多少、关税的<strong>成本由谁承担</strong>（incidence）、以及政策在<strong>多国多部门下的一般均衡</strong>效应（贸易转移、投入产出连锁、汇率调整）。这些必须用<strong>定量贸易/结构模型</strong>。\n代表性框架是 Eaton–Kortum（2002）式或 Caliendo–Parro（2015, <em>ReStud</em>）式的多国多部门一般均衡模型：各国各部门生产率服从 Fréchet 分布，贸易份额由价格与贸易成本决定，投入产出联系把部门串联。模型用几个行为弹性刻画响应——贸易弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>、替代弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>——用<strong>贸易数据估计或校准</strong>，然后在此结构上做<strong>反事实</strong>：移除补贴或关税，重解一般均衡，比较福利。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></munder><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = \\sum_{s} \\alpha_s \\ln\\left(\\sum_{j} \\left(c_{js}\\right)^{-\\theta}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这类模型的价值在于它<strong>能算 DID 算不出的量</strong>。Kalouptsidi（2014, <em>AER</em>）用造船业结构模型评估日韩补贴，发现若无政府补贴，中国造船业产能将大幅收缩——这类反事实是纯 DID 无法构造的。Fajgelbaum, Goldberg, Kennedy &amp; Khandelwal（2020, <em>QJE</em>）评估 2018–2019 年美国关税，结论是关税成本<strong>几乎完全由美国进口商承担</strong>，而非出口国；Amiti, Redding &amp; Weinstein（2019, <em>JEP</em>）给出方向一致的证据：进口价格几乎一对一随关税上升。结构模型的代价是<strong>对函数形式与弹性取值高度敏感</strong>，反事实常被批评为「假设驱动」；稳健做法是并报多个弹性取值下的结果，并标注哪些结论依赖关键弹性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>DID / 事件研究</th>\n<th>结构 / 定量贸易模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>识别来源</td>\n<td>平行趋势 + 外生处理时点</td>\n<td>模型结构 + 校准弹性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据要求</td>\n<td>面板数据、明确的处理组/对照组</td>\n<td>多国多部门投入产出与贸易矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可回答</td>\n<td>处理组相对变化、动态路径</td>\n<td>福利、incidence、贸易转移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要弱点</td>\n<td>溢出与 SUTVA 违背、交错处理偏误</td>\n<td>函数形式敏感、弹性不确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互补用法</td>\n<td>为结构模型提供「处理效应」矩</td>\n<td>为 DID 的局部效应提供全局含义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>产业政策评估没有「万能方法」，只有<strong>方法—问题匹配</strong>。实践中的可靠路径是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>先定义清楚要估计什么</strong>：是处理组相对变化，还是全局福利？前者用 DID/事件研究，后者用结构模型，两者互补而非替代。</li>\n<li><strong>交错处理必须用现代估计量</strong>：TWFE 在交错处理下会因禁止比较与负权重给出错误符号，改用 Callaway–Sant&#39;Anna、Sun–Abraham 或 Borusyak et al. 插补估计量。</li>\n<li><strong>平行趋势要证伪而非确证</strong>：预趋势检验低功效（Roth, 2022），用 HonestDiD（Rambachan &amp; Roth, 2023）报告「结论翻转所需的偏离幅度」。</li>\n<li><strong>处理时点就是政策问题本身</strong>：法案签署、申请、备忘录、拨款到账是四个不同的问题，选择必须由政策意图决定。</li>\n<li><strong>警惕同期政策与溢出</strong>：CHIPS/IRA/欧盟法案叠加时，对照组可能已被污染，SUTVA 违背是系统性风险而非边角情形。</li>\n<li><strong>报告聚合权重与弹性取值</strong>：异质效应如何聚合、结构模型弹性如何取值，直接决定数字，必须透明披露。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对做跨境电商与全球供应链实践的人来说，这套方法的实用价值在于：当平台或卖家引用「某国补贴导致产能转移」时，能判断该结论来自哪种识别策略、假设是否成立、以及它能否支撑所声称的一般均衡结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"产业政策效果的计量评估：DID、事件研究与结构模型","id":"产业政策效果的计量评估-did-事件研究与结构模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双重差分与交错处理的陷阱","id":"双重差分与交错处理的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"事件研究与平行趋势的检验与证伪","id":"事件研究与平行趋势的检验与证伪"},{"level":2,"text":"从补贴额到因果效应：识别策略的实战设计","id":"从补贴额到因果效应-识别策略的实战设计"},{"level":2,"text":"结构模型与一般均衡评估","id":"结构模型与一般均衡评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"执行偏差、利益集团俘获与腐败风险防控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/industrial-policy-strategic-trade-pe/implementation-state-capacity/implementation-capture-and-corruption"},"next":{"title":"供应链安全、友岸外包与去风险化政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-economy/industrial-policy-strategic-trade-pe/evaluation-global-governance/supply-chain-security-reshoring"}}